Subject: Select portable original render-state packing and lifecycle

Upstream-base: 132cdee912111da6c9973b1dce13651f1979b07d

Preserve Wii raster/texture ID widths and the original texture bit ordering:
logical bits 0-31 occupy the high word of the numeric u64. Replace only the
native glSetTextureState assembly path, retaining the original console body.
Use numeric shifts for native extraction, including fields crossing the word
boundary. Validate native state/type enums and matrix storage before use, and
reset state before memory teardown. Add a hash copy for selected-source
diagnostics, leaving the complete original gl.cpp body unchanged. Full
material/GX state dispatch is separate.

